<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Single click DAKKA burst using right and left clicks to mask the macro a bit. 

Setup your weapons with both the 1 and 2 section with sequentional shots selected for each. This maco will make you look like a pro with your duel clicking</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>LeftDown 1
Delay 30 60 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 30 60 ms
RightDown 1
Delay 30 65 ms
RightUp 1
Delay 30 65 ms
GoWhile 1 8</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Mech Warrior Online</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>